ok   sniff recognises PNG, JPEG, GIF87a, GIF89a, WebP and PDF
ok   sniff never reports SVG, HTML, XML or script
ok   sniff on short and empty input is the unknown type
ok   sniff needs both the RIFF and the WEBP tag
ok   sniff reads bytes across NUL and 0xFF
ok   inline_safe? is an exact match on the four raster types
ok   sanitize_filename keeps an ordinary name
ok   sanitize_filename drops a path, however it is spelled
